+:::note
+
+Querying a metadata table requires the SELECT privilege on its base table. Metadata tables expose per-column lower and upper bounds and partition values, to which row access and column masking policies cannot be applied. Therefore, a user to whom a row access policy or a column masking policy on the base table applies cannot query the metadata tables of that table.
